WEBVTT

01:30.860 --> 01:32.980
<b><i>The fight against the Magia Lupus...</i></b>

01:33.820 --> 01:38.110
<b><i>Lance was victorious in the battle
with the Third Fang of Magia Lupus, Wirth Madl.</i></b>

01:39.620 --> 01:44.790
<b><i>Mash also won against the Second Fang
of Magia Lupus, Abyss Razor.</i></b>

01:47.500 --> 01:51.590
<b><i>And now, Dot and Finn's battle begins.</i></b>

01:56.300 --> 01:58.090
<b><i>Go to the basement.</i></b>

02:00.510 --> 02:02.010
<b>Disclose.</b>

02:13.570 --> 02:16.320
<b>That geezer sure likes to boss people around.</b>

02:21.570 --> 02:22.620
<b>Love.</b>

02:22.950 --> 02:24.620
<b>I'm leaving this up to you.</b>

02:24.870 --> 02:25.790
<b>Okay.</b>

02:25.790 --> 02:27.750
<b>- Damn you, where do you—
- You know what?</b>

02:27.910 --> 02:32.880
<b>My name's Love.
I'm the Fifth Fang of Magia Lupus.</b>

02:34.550 --> 02:37.260
<b>CUTE CUTE</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:37.260
<b>Do ya like me?</b>

02:37.510 --> 02:38.300
<b>Huh?</b>

02:39.220 --> 02:42.760
<b>Hey. Do you like me, or don't ya?</b>

02:43.050 --> 02:46.850
<b>It's just, I barely know you, so...
Right, Finn?</b>

02:46.850 --> 02:48.390
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

02:48.640 --> 02:50.900
<b>Okay, so... Am I cute?</b>

02:51.060 --> 02:54.900
<b>Hey, hey. Do ya think I'm cute?</b>

02:54.900 --> 02:56.570
<b>Tell me I'm cute!</b>

02:56.570 --> 02:58.780
<b><i>She's super manipulative.</i></b>

02:57.150 --> 03:02.410
<b>Hey, hey, hey!</b>

02:59.070 --> 03:02.410
<b><i>A normie would find this
manipulativeness so revolting.</i></b>

03:02.530 --> 03:04.030
<b>C'mon!</b>

03:04.030 --> 03:05.910
<b>Am I cute?</b>

03:06.660 --> 03:09.410
<b>But I really love girls like that, damn it!</b>

03:06.660 --> 03:09.410
<b>THMP</b>

03:10.370 --> 03:14.630
<b>But I have a future fiancée
named Lemon already.</b>

03:14.710 --> 03:17.460
<b>So I'm sorry, I can't marry you.</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:19.670
<b><i>This isn't even a conversation!</i></b>

03:19.970 --> 03:23.550
<b>What? You love someone else?</b>

03:23.640 --> 03:24.640
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:24.930 --> 03:26.720
<b>Do you like her more than Love?</b>

03:26.970 --> 03:27.970
<b>Sorry.</b>

03:28.770 --> 03:30.350
<b>I see.</b>

03:31.060 --> 03:32.270
<b>Then I guess...</b>

03:34.940 --> 03:36.190
<b>you can die.</b>

03:36.770 --> 03:39.570
<b><i>What an emotionally unstable girl!</i></b>

03:39.740 --> 03:40.950
<b>Tornegus!</b>

03:40.950 --> 03:41.950
<b>Explomb!</b>

03:47.620 --> 03:52.580
<b><i>Damn it. I knew a double-liner'd
be tough in terms of magic power...</i></b>

03:53.120 --> 03:54.580
<b>All girls...</b>

03:54.750 --> 03:57.090
<b>are born princesses!</b>

03:57.290 --> 04:01.170
<b>You tell them they're cute!
And you love and serve them!</b>

04:01.170 --> 04:03.090
<b>Any guy who can't do that...</b>

04:04.390 --> 04:06.220
<b>can just die already!</b>

04:07.760 --> 04:09.890
<b>That's so extreme.</b>

04:10.140 --> 04:11.230
<b>I'm scared.</b>

04:11.480 --> 04:13.270
<b>So I'll ask one more time, okay?</b>

04:13.270 --> 04:16.150
<b>Well? Do ya love me, or don't ya?</b>

04:16.150 --> 04:22.240
<b><i>Geez. We just met, and she says
love her or die. Is she nuts?</i></b>

04:22.400 --> 04:23.860
<b>Hey.</b>

04:23.860 --> 04:25.110
<b>Am I cute?</b>

04:25.870 --> 04:28.620
<b>But you know what? I'm totally into it!</b>

04:25.870 --> 04:28.620
<b>THMP</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:34.170
<b>But still, I have a future fiancée
named Lemon already.</b>

04:34.540 --> 04:37.460
<b>So once again, I'm sorry. I can't marry you.</b>

04:37.460 --> 04:39.380
<b><i>Didn't we just go over this?</i></b>

04:39.550 --> 04:43.260
<b>No, I really am sorry.
Despite my looks, I'm a devoted gu—</b>

04:47.470 --> 04:48.720
<b>Dot!</b>

04:49.760 --> 04:51.020
<b>Not bad.</b>

04:51.020 --> 04:52.020
<b>What isn't?</b>

04:52.100 --> 04:54.190
<b>This just had to happen.</b>

04:54.940 --> 05:01.530
<b>Daddy said I can kill
any guy who doesn't cherish me.</b>

05:02.740 --> 05:06.490
<b>Yeah, yeah. Go tell your daddy...</b>

05:07.530 --> 05:09.240
<b>that I don't care what he thinks!</b>

05:09.620 --> 05:10.990
<b>Explomb!</b>

05:11.080 --> 05:15.540
<b>Don't you understand your magic power
is no match against me?</b>

05:15.660 --> 05:16.710
<b>Tornegus!</b>

05:23.510 --> 05:26.970
<b><i>What? He intentionally aimed short of me
to block my vision.</i></b>

05:29.430 --> 05:31.220
<b><i>He's after my wand.</i></b>

05:37.770 --> 05:44.110
<b>Too bad! You're too weak.
You can't beat me.</b>

05:45.570 --> 05:48.610
<b>I'll tell you one more thing.</b>

05:48.740 --> 05:55.870
<b>The Fourth Fang of Magia Lupus, Milo Genius,
can turn a specified target to stone.</b>

05:55.870 --> 06:00.500
<b>And by target, I mean the person
who opened that underground door.</b>

06:00.840 --> 06:05.380
<b>I'd say it takes effect around two hours
after he's started storing energy.</b>

06:05.380 --> 06:06.510
<b>Meaning...</b>

06:06.720 --> 06:11.640
<b>If you don't defeat me
and get to the Fourth in 30 minutes...</b>

06:12.140 --> 06:16.140
<b>it's the end for that Mushroom Head
because he'll turn into a statue.</b>

06:16.350 --> 06:19.350
<b>Not that you can do anything about it.</b>

06:20.310 --> 06:22.270
<b>Tornegus Cage!</b>

06:27.110 --> 06:31.280
<b>Once you're caught in this tornado,
it's impossible to escape from it!</b>

06:31.410 --> 06:32.410
<b>Dot!</b>

06:35.290 --> 06:38.410
<b>Having to put up with such weak friends...</b>

06:38.410 --> 06:42.290
<b>Poor Mushroom Head. I feel for him.</b>

06:43.130 --> 06:46.800
<b>Though, it's what he gets
for going up against Lord Abel.</b>

06:47.130 --> 06:50.180
<b>Facing someone
without knowing their strength...</b>

06:50.180 --> 06:53.300
<b>He's clueless. Just like you.</b>

06:53.510 --> 06:56.310
<b>It really is so funny!</b>

06:57.470 --> 07:00.020
<b><i>It hurts all over. I feel like I'm dying.</i></b>

07:00.230 --> 07:02.520
<b><i>Even my bones sting.</i></b>

07:03.060 --> 07:05.020
<b><i>I can barely breathe.</i></b>

07:06.320 --> 07:08.610
<b><i>This girl's right.</i></b>

07:08.780 --> 07:12.660
<b><i>She outclasses me.
There's nothing I can do.</i></b>

07:15.580 --> 07:17.080
<b><i>Hey, Dot!</i></b>

07:17.700 --> 07:20.160
<b>You got a new broom, right?</b>

07:20.160 --> 07:21.830
<b>Trade with me.</b>

07:22.120 --> 07:25.460
<b>B-But... This broom is...</b>

07:25.460 --> 07:27.670
<b>Come on, it's fine, right?</b>

07:27.670 --> 07:29.090
<b>Uh, okay.</b>

07:29.220 --> 07:30.760
<b>Thanks!</b>

07:38.020 --> 07:39.100
<b>Here.</b>

07:39.100 --> 07:40.940
<b>Thanks, Sis.</b>

07:41.390 --> 07:45.610
<b>You really are pathetic.
You should fight back.</b>

07:46.070 --> 07:51.280
<b>It's fine.
If I fight back, it just gets worse.</b>

07:52.950 --> 07:55.990
<b>You seriously give up too easily.</b>

07:56.740 --> 07:57.790
<b>But...</b>

07:58.660 --> 08:02.870
<b>That's gonna be a problem
once you get a real friend.</b>

08:03.460 --> 08:05.330
<b>A real friend?</b>

08:05.500 --> 08:10.420
<b>That's right. Someone who'll honestly
get sad or angry on your behalf.</b>

08:11.260 --> 08:15.050
<b>Though, that kinda person
comes around only once in a lifetime.</b>

08:15.850 --> 08:20.310
<b>If you find that friend...
never betray them.</b>

08:23.940 --> 08:26.730
<b><i>Basically, he's having a delusion!</i></b>

08:26.730 --> 08:29.190
<b><i>Does he think he's the main character
or something?</i></b>

08:29.610 --> 08:30.780
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

08:31.280 --> 08:33.150
<b><i>That's so cheesy.</i></b>

08:33.280 --> 08:37.870
<b><i>I hate stuffy guys like you.</i></b>

08:38.200 --> 08:41.120
<b><i>I really am pathetic.</i></b>

08:41.500 --> 08:44.000
<b><i>You guys have gone far enough.</i></b>

08:44.460 --> 08:47.750
<b><i>Getting scared while she mocks my buddy.</i></b>

08:49.710 --> 08:52.260
<b><i>Come at me, scumbag.</i></b>

08:52.760 --> 08:57.010
<b><i>He honestly got angry on my behalf, too!</i></b>

08:57.470 --> 09:02.640
<b>Meanwhile, I guess I'll deal with you, Freckles.</b>

09:05.980 --> 09:07.400
<b>Bye-bye.</b>

09:09.190 --> 09:10.900
<b>Tor...</b>

09:12.110 --> 09:13.900
<b>negu...</b>

09:18.990 --> 09:21.120
<b>I can't let it end like this.</b>

09:23.120 --> 09:25.870
<b>Not when you mocked my friend!</b>

09:26.460 --> 09:27.330
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

09:27.330 --> 09:29.290
<b><i>What's with his magic power?</i></b>

09:29.420 --> 09:31.420
<b><i>He broke my spell?</i></b>

09:31.750 --> 09:33.050
<b>Dot?</b>

09:33.420 --> 09:36.430
<b>You're worn out.
You're just being obnoxious!</b>

09:36.430 --> 09:37.550
<b>Tornegus!</b>

09:37.550 --> 09:39.050
<b>Explomb!</b>

09:41.930 --> 09:43.560
<b><i>Cancelled out?</i></b>

09:43.970 --> 09:47.100
<b><i>His power's jumped up a level!</i></b>

09:47.100 --> 09:50.060
<b><i>How did he amplify magic power so quickly?</i></b>

09:50.360 --> 09:54.070
<b><i>Wait. That mark. I've heard about it.</i></b>

09:54.070 --> 09:57.450
<b><i>Children born with the Warding Cross
on their foreheads...</i></b>

09:57.660 --> 10:03.660
<b><i>Battle demons who unleash their magic power
when their emotions cross a certain threshold.</i></b>

10:06.160 --> 10:08.000
<b><i>The Ira Kreuz!</i></b>

10:16.760 --> 10:20.220
<b>Insulting my friend is a serious crime.</b>

10:20.640 --> 10:24.140
<b>Machine Gun Explomb!</b>

10:28.190 --> 10:30.600
<b>Thirty minutes before he turns to stone?</b>

10:30.900 --> 10:33.980
<b>There's no way
I'll let you two get in his way.</b>

10:34.530 --> 10:38.030
<b>Come at me, scumbag.</b>

10:43.620 --> 10:45.660
<b>Die... 100 times.</b>

11:01.260 --> 11:03.180
<b>He missed on purpose?</b>

11:03.720 --> 11:05.930
<b>I don't like picking on girls.</b>

11:06.430 --> 11:07.520
<b>Get lost.</b>

11:07.930 --> 11:10.520
<b>Before I change my mind.</b>

11:10.940 --> 11:15.360
<b>O-Okay. Thankyu vewy much.</b>

11:15.940 --> 11:17.820
<b>And there you have it!</b>

11:19.200 --> 11:22.950
<b><i>He was eerily calm for a moment,
but already back to normal.</i></b>

11:23.200 --> 11:28.290
<b><i>Still, he defeated the Fifth Fang all on his own.
I didn't know Dot was a double-liner, too.</i></b>

11:28.750 --> 11:29.660
<b>Dot, you're amaz...</b>

11:39.670 --> 11:41.180
<b>Dot...</b>

11:42.470 --> 11:44.680
<b>Sorry! I'm sorry, Dot!</b>

11:45.050 --> 11:48.680
<b>I thought I could let you
take care of two single-liners.</b>

11:50.890 --> 11:54.190
<b>But I come back to find this?</b>

11:54.310 --> 11:55.690
<b>Oopsies!</b>

11:56.190 --> 11:57.480
<b><i>The Fourth Fang.</i></b>

11:57.690 --> 12:00.900
<b><i>He gave up his petrification spell
to face us.</i></b>

12:01.400 --> 12:04.950
<b>It's not like these guys
ever proved to be much of a challenge.</b>

12:05.200 --> 12:06.830
<b>Especially guys like them.</b>

12:10.580 --> 12:11.660
<b><i>Damn it.</i></b>

12:11.660 --> 12:14.000
<b><i>Caught me off guard.</i></b>

12:14.330 --> 12:17.210
<b><i>Can I even fight the Fourth like this?</i></b>

12:17.670 --> 12:22.220
<b><i>The Fourth Fang is a prodigy, the only
first-year student among the Magia Lupus.</i></b>

12:23.470 --> 12:24.970
<b><i>It's the end for you.</i></b>

12:32.060 --> 12:33.520
<b><i>What the...</i></b>

12:33.770 --> 12:35.190
<b><i>Was that a sword!?</i></b>

12:36.230 --> 12:37.650
<b><i>That magic...</i></b>

12:39.360 --> 12:41.780
<b><i>Damn it. What happened?</i></b>

12:41.780 --> 12:43.570
<b><i>Why am I...</i></b>

12:43.820 --> 12:47.320
<b><i>My magic was broken in an instant.</i></b>

12:50.870 --> 12:52.580
<b><i>Wh-Why is he here?</i></b>

12:53.580 --> 12:56.960
<b><i>Divine Visionary... Rayne Ames!</i></b>

12:58.500 --> 13:02.090
<b>Wait, Rayne. Why are you here?</b>

13:04.380 --> 13:06.720
<b><i>Divine Visionary, Rayne Ames.</i></b>

13:07.390 --> 13:09.310
<b><i>Adler dorm's ace!</i></b>

13:09.890 --> 13:12.850
<b><i>Divine Visionary or not,
he's still a student.</i></b>

13:12.850 --> 13:14.980
<b><i>There's no need to panic.</i></b>

13:15.100 --> 13:16.730
<b>R-Right. Okay.</b>

13:16.850 --> 13:18.270
<b>Let's talk about this.</b>

13:18.270 --> 13:20.730
<b>We've both got our reasons.</b>

13:20.900 --> 13:21.610
<b>Right?</b>

13:25.700 --> 13:26.660
<b><i>Wh...</i></b>

13:28.070 --> 13:30.910
<b>Don't waste my time.</b>

13:31.660 --> 13:32.910
<b>You piece of trash.</b>

13:38.500 --> 13:41.550
<b><i>He's a student like us, isn't he?</i></b>

13:47.090 --> 13:50.550
<b><i>This is what a Visionary
is magically capable of...</i></b>

13:51.890 --> 13:54.430
<b>Maybe I should defect to Adler for now.</b>

13:57.900 --> 14:02.480
<b><i>No, no, no. It's too different.
There's too much of a difference.</i></b>

14:04.110 --> 14:07.200
<b>It's not what you think! I had no choice!</b>

14:07.200 --> 14:11.280
<b>I regret being unable
to stand up against him! Forgive me!</b>

14:12.160 --> 14:13.330
<b>That so?</b>

14:19.460 --> 14:21.670
<b>You regret it?</b>

14:22.920 --> 14:28.470
<b>The most important thing
in this world is actions. Not words.</b>

14:29.180 --> 14:33.390
<b>I don't trust the words of a scum like you.</b>

14:33.970 --> 14:39.520
<b>It's best to teach your type...
through pain.</b>

14:40.190 --> 14:46.070
<b>So that you never think about
making the same mistake ever again.</b>

14:47.780 --> 14:51.570
<b><i>I heard he's in Adler like us.
So he's on our side, right?</i></b>

14:51.870 --> 14:55.120
<b>And what are you guys doing here?</b>

14:57.120 --> 14:59.080
<b>Hurry up and get out.</b>

14:59.460 --> 15:02.540
<b>I'm going to drag the details out of him.</b>

15:03.000 --> 15:04.670
<b>O-Okay.</b>

15:08.090 --> 15:09.090
<b>Spill it.</b>

15:09.430 --> 15:11.340
<b><i>Dude's harsh.</i></b>

15:10.890 --> 15:14.510
<b>Hey, didn't you hear me?
I told you to spill it.</b>

15:11.340 --> 15:14.510
<b><i>But what brings a Divine Visionary here?</i></b>

15:15.600 --> 15:16.930
<b>Brother.</b>

15:16.930 --> 15:17.810
<b>What?</b>

15:22.190 --> 15:26.940
<b><i>The geezer said
Innocent Zero's pawns are here.</i></b>

15:27.440 --> 15:31.860
<b><i>No doubt they're concealing
their power to hide.</i></b>

15:32.450 --> 15:34.200
<b><i>But where are they?</i></b>

15:37.910 --> 15:40.870
<b>Gettin' nutrition. Gettin' nutrition.</b>

15:38.370 --> 15:40.870
<b>NOM NOM</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:42.960
<b><i>That's not magic.</i></b>

15:43.250 --> 15:45.960
<b><i>But this immense pressure...</i></b>

15:46.460 --> 15:47.840
<b><i>It must be him.</i></b>

15:47.840 --> 15:49.130
<b>Need to hurry.</b>

15:49.550 --> 15:50.800
<b>Hurry, and...</b>

15:52.720 --> 15:54.260
<b>I'm short on time.</b>

15:54.680 --> 15:57.140
<b>I'll make this investigation quick.</b>

15:57.890 --> 15:58.770
<b>What?</b>

16:00.600 --> 16:05.020
<b>This creature will measure
your true magic power.</b>

16:05.360 --> 16:09.400
<b>I can tell by magic power levels
if you're really a student or not.</b>

16:09.900 --> 16:10.650
<b>Huh?</b>

16:10.740 --> 16:15.910
<b>These eight legs of mine have tallied
the power of thousands of magic users.</b>

16:16.330 --> 16:21.580
<b>If you're a regular magic user,
Master Rayne will let you scuttle on by.</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:23.040
<b>No way.</b>

16:30.970 --> 16:33.300
<b>Excuse me. What was that so suddenly?</b>

16:33.800 --> 16:35.550
<b>That's pretty dangerous.</b>

16:36.430 --> 16:38.810
<b>Stranger danger. So barbaric.</b>

16:37.430 --> 16:38.810
<b><i>Did he...</i></b>

16:39.010 --> 16:41.810
<b><i>use any magic at all?</i></b>

16:44.190 --> 16:45.770
<b>Z-Zero?</b>

16:45.770 --> 16:47.770
<b>No, no, no, no.</b>

16:47.770 --> 16:50.190
<b>I miscalculated.
A bug in the system. That's all.</b>

16:50.190 --> 16:52.950
<b><i>He's not registering on the Arachnabus.</i></b>

16:54.110 --> 16:55.450
<b><i>Could he be...</i></b>

16:57.780 --> 17:00.450
<b>Three Percent Partisan.</b>

17:04.960 --> 17:06.960
<b>BAM</b>

17:07.420 --> 17:09.800
<b><i>He made a chair out of my partisans.</i></b>

17:10.130 --> 17:11.510
<b>You're kidding me.</b>

17:11.510 --> 17:17.260
<b><i>Arachnabus has lost sight of itself.
It's even stopped using spider puns.</i></b>

17:17.970 --> 17:21.470
<b><i>As I expected, this guy isn't using magic.</i></b>

17:21.930 --> 17:25.980
<b><i>He's not one of Innocent Zero's men.
However...</i></b>

17:22.810 --> 17:24.270
<b>I'm getting miffed.</b>

17:26.650 --> 17:29.190
<b>Just one more test.</b>

17:30.320 --> 17:33.610
<b>Ten Percent Partisan.</b>

17:33.740 --> 17:38.120
<b><i>This is not a spell Master Rayne uses
against a student. This guy is fini...</i></b>

17:39.620 --> 17:41.240
<b><i>Practice swings?</i></b>

17:41.330 --> 17:42.540
<b><i>Could it be...</i></b>

17:43.200 --> 17:44.750
<b><i>Is that...</i></b>

17:44.960 --> 17:47.210
<b><i>a bunting stance?</i></b>

17:53.510 --> 17:57.220
<b><i>He's bunting
all of Master Rayne's attacks and...</i></b>

17:58.970 --> 18:00.970
<b><i>tapping them out of commission!</i></b>

18:01.600 --> 18:03.220
<b>That was dangerous.</b>

18:03.390 --> 18:05.480
<b><i>Wait, what does this mean?</i></b>

18:07.230 --> 18:09.730
<b>What's your name?</b>

18:10.480 --> 18:12.400
<b>Mash Burnedead.</b>

18:13.070 --> 18:14.440
<b><i>Mash.</i></b>

18:14.780 --> 18:18.200
<b><i>We have a unique new student.</i></b>

18:18.200 --> 18:22.120
<b><i>He's in a very unique situation,</i></b>

18:22.370 --> 18:25.370
<b><i>but he has a heart that is quite strong.</i></b>

18:25.700 --> 18:29.920
<b><i>I'd like it if you could look out for him.</i></b>

18:30.330 --> 18:32.880
<b><i>His name is...</i></b>

18:33.050 --> 18:34.920
<b><i>...Burnedead.</i></b>

18:35.210 --> 18:38.010
<b>I see. You're him.</b>

18:40.800 --> 18:43.850
<b>Allow me to apologize for my rudeness.</b>

18:44.310 --> 18:45.640
<b>I am sorry.</b>

18:45.680 --> 18:48.640
<b>HA-HONK</b>

18:47.230 --> 18:48.640
<b>Not forgiven.</b>

18:51.860 --> 18:55.030
<b>It's not much of an apology,
but take this.</b>

18:56.110 --> 18:59.610
<b>It's a magic kerchief
that will heal your wounds.</b>

18:59.990 --> 19:01.660
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

19:06.620 --> 19:09.500
<b>So you like rabbits?</b>

19:18.130 --> 19:21.510
<b>DROOP</b>

19:19.550 --> 19:21.510
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

19:21.970 --> 19:24.760
<b>Be careful while you're at it.</b>

19:26.600 --> 19:28.850
<b>You're going after Abel, right?</b>

19:28.980 --> 19:30.190
<b>How did you...</b>

19:30.690 --> 19:35.440
<b>The old geezer said
you wanted to be a Divine Visionary.</b>

19:35.940 --> 19:40.030
<b>Naturally, you'd run up against Abel.</b>

19:40.610 --> 19:45.120
<b>He's definitely going to be one of this year's
Divine Visionary candidates.</b>

19:45.450 --> 19:50.540
<b>It's fair to say his doll magic far exceeds
what's required of a student.</b>

19:51.080 --> 19:55.500
<b>I was surprised you could block
my elementary magic with your bare hands.</b>

19:56.000 --> 20:00.050
<b>But without any magic,
you're going to have a tough time.</b>

20:00.090 --> 20:04.930
<b>BLUNT</b>

20:01.260 --> 20:03.800
<b>But I can use magic...</b>

20:05.260 --> 20:10.770
<b>In any case, he holds
most of the coins in the school.</b>

20:11.730 --> 20:15.020
<b>Beat him and they'll all be yours,</b>

20:15.020 --> 20:17.940
<b>bringing you a lot closer
to becoming a Divine Visionary candidate.</b>

20:20.150 --> 20:23.700
<b>Our world has no shortage of problems.</b>

20:24.070 --> 20:27.580
<b>For allies, I want people
who are strong on their own.</b>

20:28.620 --> 20:31.250
<b>You said you wanted
to be a Divine Visionary.</b>

20:32.000 --> 20:33.830
<b>Then do it, even if it kills you.</b>

20:38.840 --> 20:40.090
<b>'Kay.</b>

20:40.380 --> 20:44.180
<b>I've got other things to do.
Watch yourself.</b>

20:44.590 --> 20:47.600
<b>Um... Thank you for everything.</b>

20:48.760 --> 20:53.480
<b>This is all for my own sake.
Don't get me wrong.</b>

20:54.190 --> 20:55.270
<b>Later.</b>

20:58.440 --> 21:00.190
<b>He's probably a good guy.</b>

21:02.860 --> 21:09.330
<b><i>He's a curious child who puts his friends
ahead of his own goals.</i></b>

21:09.450 --> 21:13.620
<b><i>It could be that
he's just the simple sort.</i></b>

21:13.910 --> 21:19.380
<b><i>Though meeting him seems to have
saved your younger brother.</i></b>

21:19.750 --> 21:23.420
<b><i>You can become a Divine Visionary
even if you can't use magic.</i></b>

21:23.760 --> 21:30.510
<b><i>And to do that, prove that you're greater
than any magic user.</i></b>

21:31.350 --> 21:33.140
<b>This must be it.</b>

21:33.480 --> 21:35.600
<b>Do I push or pull to open this door?</b>

21:36.100 --> 21:38.020
<b>Oh, I push to open.</b>

21:53.910 --> 21:58.210
<b>Must you destroy every door you enter?</b>

21:58.790 --> 22:03.050
<b>I tried to knock,
and this is what happened.</b>

23:35.260 --> 23:39.980
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MASH BURNEDEAD AND THE SURVIVAL OF THE FITTEST</b>
